# Intentionally no Buck2 target yet.
#
# This arch backend needs the pinned-nightly build-std x86_64-unknown-none
# platform plus nested-workspace no_std third-party deps. Exposing it as a
# placeholder Buck2 target before that platform/toolchain exists makes direct
# builds fail while wildcard builds skip it, which is false-green CI coverage.
# See //cloud/cloud-kernel:BUCK.
